      "text": "Design LeetCode\n- Sameer Shaikh",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Design LeetCode\n- Sameer Shaikh",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "o-b2vZgoUeGK3T_-Ap8Sm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 313,
      "y": 51.50000762939453,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 1875,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#f08c00",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b31",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 843865531,
      "version": 2322,
      "versionNonce": 2043737653,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792169592254,
      "created": 1792136426030,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n- user can list category based problems\n- user can submit solution problems \n- user can choose solution language\n- user register/login\n- user can participate in contest and after submition \nthey can see leaderboard and rank\n- Admin can add,update,delete Problems\n- Admin can add test cases\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n- Availability >> Consistency\n- user should execute and test solution in isolation \n- Low latency for submission and feed back p99 ~300ms\n- Should support a Million DAU\n\nBack of envelope estimation\n- 1M DAU, 3000 coding problems \n- 10qps at peak 10*3 = 30qps\n- 500KB for a problem 3*5*10^8 = ~1.5GB \n- throughput 30*100KB = ~3MB \n- bandwidth 3*8= ~24Mbps\n\n\nCore Entities\n- Problem\n- Solution\n- LeaderBoard\n- User\n\nApi Design\n// create new problem\nPOST /problems/create\n{\ntitle,\ncategory[],\ndescription,\nimage?,\nexample,\ntestCases[]\n    } -> 201, 403\n\nPUT /problems/{problemId}\n{\ntitle,\ncategory[],\ndescription,\nimage?,\nexample,\ntestCases[]\n} -> 204,\n\nDELETE /problems/{problemId} -> 200\n\n//list problems\nGET /problems/list?category={}&limit={}&offset={} -> List<Problems> pagination\n\n//Fetch  Single problem\nGET /problems/{problemId}?language={} -> 200, <Problem>\n\n// Submit Solution\nPOST /problems/{problemId}/solution\n{\n    language:string,\n    code:string\n} -> 201, <Boolean>\n\n// leader board\nGET /leaderboard/{competitionId}?limit={}&offset={} -> 200, 204\nList<LeaderBoard>\n\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n- user can list category based problems\n- user can submit solution problems \n- user can choose solution language\n- user register/login\n- user can participate in contest and after submition \nthey can see leaderboard and rank\n- Admin can add,update,delete Problems\n- Admin can add test cases\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n- Availability >> Consistency\n- user should execute and test solution in isolation \n- Low latency for submission and feed back p99 ~300ms\n- Should support a Million DAU\n\nBack of envelope estimation\n- 1M DAU, 3000 coding problems \n- 10qps at peak 10*3 = 30qps\n- 500KB for a problem 3*5*10^8 = ~1.5GB \n- throughput 30*100KB = ~3MB \n- bandwidth 3*8= ~24Mbps\n\n\nCore Entities\n- Problem\n- Solution\n- LeaderBoard\n- User\n\nApi Design\n// create new problem\nPOST /problems/create\n{\ntitle,\ncategory[],\ndescription,\nimage?,\nexample,\ntestCases[]\n    } -> 201, 403\n\nPUT /problems/{problemId}\n{\ntitle,\ncategory[],\ndescription,\nimage?,\nexample,\ntestCases[]\n} -> 204,\n\nDELETE /problems/{problemId} -> 200\n\n//list problems\nGET /problems/list?category={}&limit={}&offset={} -> List<Problems> pagination\n\n//Fetch  Single problem\nGET /problems/{problemId}?language={} -> 200, <Problem>\n\n// Submit Solution\nPOST /problems/{problemId}/solution\n{\n    language:string,\n    code:string\n} -> 201, <Boolean>\n\n// leader board\nGET /leaderboard/{competitionId}?limit={}&offset={} -> 200, 204 List<LeaderBoard>\n\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
